## Claim
Text: "Former FBI Director James Comey and former CIA Director John Brennan have been charged with multiple counts of treason."
Claim author: Paul Raczkowski
Claim date: September 14, 2020
Claim origin: https://www.facebook.com/paulraczkowski/posts/10158532554343377

## Initial Q&A
### As of September 14, 2020, had former FBI Director James Comey been formally charged with any federal crime by the United States Department of Justice?
Answer: As of September 14, 2020, former FBI Director James Comey had not been formally charged with any federal crime by the U.S. Department of Justice. According to an NBC News report, while the Justice Department's internal watchdog referred him for prosecution over leaking memos, "the Department of Justice, however, declined to prosecute Comey."

Source URL: https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/justice-department/justice-department-won-t-prosecute-comey-over-leak-his-memos-n1038326

### As of September 14, 2020, had former CIA Director John Brennan been formally charged with any federal crime by the United States Department of Justice?
Answer: Based on the search result, as of September 14, 2020, there is no indication that former CIA Director John Brennan had been formally charged with any federal crime. The article describes an ongoing investigation by prosecutor John Durham into the origins of the Russia probe, for which Brennan was asked to be interviewed, but it makes no mention of any charges being filed against him.

Source URL: https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/justice-department/trump-administration-s-probe-russia-investigation-may-be-nearing-conclusion-n1235904

